WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.603
Detection lifecycle management treats detections as living operational assets.

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:08.986
Effective programs manage intake, prioritization, design, documentation, testing,

00:00:08.986 --> 00:00:12.549
deployment, tuning, review, metrics, retirement, and continuous improvement.

00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:16.058
Detections should have purpose, ownership, telemetry, analyst guidance,

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:17.208
and feedback loops.

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:19.112
The goal is not to create the most alerts.

00:00:19.112 --> 00:00:23.910
The goal is to maintain meaningful signals that support defensive decision-making over

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:23.920
time.
